# PPM Edge Runtime

A deterministic, ultra-low-latency runtime for privacy-preserving adaptive regulation on wearables, edge AI systems, and resource-constrained devices.

## Core idea

PPM Edge Runtime is designed around a simple principle:

> Process sensitive signals locally, make a bounded decision locally, and retain as little information as possible.

The runtime is intended for systems where conventional cloud-based biometric processing creates unnecessary latency, bandwidth, power, storage, or privacy exposure.

## Design goals

- Deterministic execution
- Ultra-low latency
- Minimal memory footprint
- Minimal persistent storage
- Local-first processing
- No required cloud connection
- No required biometric data storage
- Explicit priority handling
- Bounded adaptive regulation
- Suitable for wearable and embedded systems
- Easy integration with sensors and edge-AI pipelines

## Architecture

```text
Sensor
  |
  v
